<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37736" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξώλ-ης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ες</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>utterly destroyed, ruined,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. γίνεσθαι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdt.
					7.9
				</span></i>
			.
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">β́; ἐξώλεις καὶ προώλεις ποιεῖν τινας
					ἐν γῇ καὶ ἐν θαλάσσῃ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					18.324
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				19.71
			</span></i>; freq. in imprecations, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ἀπόλοιο</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pax</u>
					1072
				</span></i>
			, <i><span class="en">
				Men.
				<u>Sam.</u>
				152
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξώλη αὐτὸν εἶναι καὶ
			γένος</span> Lexap.<i><span class="en">
				And.
				1.98
			</span></i>, cf.<i><span class="en">
				126
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξώλη γίνεσθαι καὶ αὐτὸν καὶ τοὺς
					ἐκείνου πάντας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>SIG</u>
					167.15
				</span></i>
			 (Mylasa, <span class="entity">iv B. C.</span>); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐ. ἀπολοίμην καὶ προώλης</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					19.172
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> metaph., of
			persons, <i>pernicious, abominable,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Αἰγύπτου γένος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					A.
					<u>Supp.</u>
					741
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γέρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eup.
					45
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οὐδὲν πέφυκε ζῷον -έστερον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>Pl.</u>
					443
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ec.</u>
				1053
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				1070
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				58.63
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Antiph.
				159.12
			</span></i>, etc.</div>
